{"id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-satisfaction.md","title":"First-order satisfaction (legacy)","display":"df-satisfaction — First-order satisfaction (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-satisfaction","aliases":["27-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — First-order satisfaction (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]","[[27-df-structure]]","[[27-df-assignment]]","[[27-df-term-interpretation]]","[[27-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — First-order satisfaction (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1530bb34c38bf5bb\" href=\"?note=1530bb34c38bf5bb\" title=\"27-df-term-interpretation\">27-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；项解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1530bb34c38bf5bb\" href=\"?note=1530bb34c38bf5bb\" title=\"27-df-term-interpretation\">27-df-term-interpretation</a>，语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a>。关系符号及其项列在关系原子分支中局部限定；允许无关系符号的签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\)</span> 是待定义的语义关系；公式树内的连接词与关系两侧的元语言连接词按各自位置区分。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span> 是任意候选集合对象。句子满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\\models\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\models\\sigma\\)</span> 对所有候选对象定义；非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构上的值由最后一式给定。带赋值的满足关系仍只在前述合法结构、公式和赋值上递归定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(t\\doteq u)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(t\\doteq u)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_m^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_m^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\longrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\longrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak C,S)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathfrak C\\models\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak C,S)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\mathfrak C\\models\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>分开三个二元真值分支，消除旧 Remark 才说明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 对象/元语言解释。补入无赋值的句子满足记号，供 logical-consequence、theory 和 elementary-equivalence 正确使用。</li>\n<li>结构递归定义有赋值满足；句子真值对赋值无关由自由变量引理的通常归纳推出，但本接口直接用所有赋值量化，因此无需暗借未写出的引理才能解释记号。非空载体保证赋值集合非空。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formu